WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:03.509
Lesson one. My Daily Routine!

2
00:00:04.459 --> 00:00:11.659
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:15.616
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:19.100
Today we learn: My Daily Routine! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:23.385
Wake up! Say it with me. Wake up!

6
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:31.492
Brush teeth! Say it with me. Brush teeth!

7
00:00:35.503 --> 00:00:40.003
Eat breakfast! Say it with me. Eat breakfast!

8
00:00:43.939 --> 00:00:48.206
Go to school! Say it with me. Go to school!

9
00:00:52.211 --> 00:00:56.077
Take a bath! Say it with me. Take a bath!

10
00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:03.750
Do homework! Say it with me. Do homework!

11
00:01:07.757 --> 00:01:11.790
Have lunch! Say it with me. Have lunch!

12
00:01:15.781 --> 00:01:19.615
Go to bed! Say it with me. Go to bed!

13
00:01:23.645 --> 00:01:29.661
Listen. I usually wake up at 6 o'clock every day.

14
00:01:29.711 --> 00:01:34.194
Say it with me. I usually wake up at 6 o'clock every day.

15
00:01:39.143 --> 00:01:45.535
I wake up early, brush my teeth, and get ready for school. After school I do my homework.

16
00:01:45.585 --> 00:01:47.005
I like this story!

17
00:01:47.778 --> 00:01:52.924
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.974 --> 00:01:54.271
Eat breakfast!

19
00:01:55.392 --> 00:02:00.784
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:02.069
Do homework!

21
00:02:03.059 --> 00:02:10.749
Value corner: Kindness. Being kind means being gentle and caring to others, even in small ways.

22
00:02:10.799 --> 00:02:12.433
I can show kindness too!

23
00:02:13.193 --> 00:02:20.487
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:20.537 --> 00:02:22.100
Bye-bye, friends!

